{"unit_id":"zlforward__dsh-agnes-media#feature-1","repo":"zlforward/dsh-agnes-media","commit":"82fa693381e1356bd859f398376a03535a4faf9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-media 的功能「图像生成与编辑」：调用 `agnes_image`，根据提示词生成图像，也可输入公开 URL、data URI 或工作区图片作为参考进行编辑和合成；结果下载后返回本地路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:244-253","lib/index.js:317-357"]}
