{"unit_id":"zlforward__dsh-agnes-media#feature-3","repo":"zlforward/dsh-agnes-media","commit":"82fa693381e1356bd859f398376a03535a4faf9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-media 的功能「工作区文件保存」：生成结果默认写入调用 agent 工作区下的 `agnes-media` 目录，也可用 `outputPath` 指定绝对或相对路径；插件创建目录并识别文件扩展名。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-145","lib/index.js:282-285","lib/index.js:574-576"]}
{"unit_id":"zlforward__dsh-agnes-media#caveat-1","repo":"zlforward/dsh-agnes-media","commit":"82fa693381e1356bd859f398376a03535a4faf9d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agnes-media 使用前须知：每次生成都需要通过 DSH credentials 解析 `AGNES_API_KEY`，图像或视频请求会发送给 Agnes API；视频参考素材必须是服务端可访问的公开 HTTP(S) URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:108-115","lib/index.js:328-335","lib/index.js:493-504"]}
